aining currently samples target angles uniformly across the full range, so the diagnosed negative-angle sector receives no additional learning exposure.", "source": "robot_learning/scenario/environment.py"}, {"observation": "The campaign strategy identifies the negative-angle non-reach cluster as the first intervention target and treats the isolated late-training hold interruptions as a separate unresolved question.", "source": "research/postmortems.md"}], "expected_observation": "A best checkpoint from the focused-sampling run has fewer non-reaches in the -122 to -145 degree sector and maintains comparable success across the remaining angular sectors.", "initialization_reason": "A fresh run isolates the effect of the target-sampling intervention from the accepted baseline's already-trained weights; transfer would confound exposure during learning with continued optimization of an existing policy.", "strategy_link": "This is the first targeted test in the campaign direction of repairing the observed negative-angle failure sector. Its result will determine whether to pursue sampling or move to representation/control and hold-stability explanations."}, "recorded_at": "2026-09-05", "requested_evaluations": [{"candidate": "checkpoint-100352", "episodes": 200, "evaluation_semantics": "fb234ea119ba", "label": "experiment-2-sector-and-hold-comparison", "metrics": {"episodes": 200, "evaluation_artifact": "research/evaluations/90890200-b313-4f38-b010-de1eaaeb3d98/evaluation-90890200-b313-4f38-b010-de1eaaeb3d98-experiment-2-checkpoint-100352-200ep-seed1-fb234ea119ba.json", "evaluation_semantics": "fb234ea119ba", "official_benchmark": false, "schema_version": 5, "seed": 1, "success_percent": 85.0}, "seed": 1}, {"candidate": "checkpoint-120832", "episodes": 200, "evaluation_semantics": "fb234ea119ba", "label": "experiment-2-sector-and-hold-comparison", "metrics": {"episodes": 200, "evaluation_artifact": "research/evaluations/90890200-b313-4f38-b010-de1eaaeb3d98/evaluation-90890